DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an evening of music for double bass and piano in the sup
 erb acoustics of Christ Episcopal Church in Montpelier. The program featur
 es a new arrangement of Bach's 2nd gamba sonata and the premiere of Nick B
 rowne's original sonata for bass and piano. Admission is by donation\, no 
 tickets required. Nick Browne\, double bass Annemieke McLane\, piano Progr
 am: Koussevitzky: Chanson Triste and Valse Miniature Bottesini: Elegy and 
 Tarantella Bach: Viola da Gamba Sonata no.2 arr. Browne Browne: Sonata for
  Double Bass and Piano Christ Episcopal Church Artist Group Info Nick Brow
 ne nmbrowne@gmail.com https://music.dartmouth.edu/people/nick-browne Chris
