BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Music at Grace: Andrew Wells-Oberegger
DTSTART:20260904T190000
DTEND:20260904T203000
DTSTAMP:20260904T150035Z
UID:06e040201903aa77a4f58d1b0d29b0@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Known for his mastery of an impressive variety of instruments 
 – such as classical guitar\, renaissance lute\, oud\, bagpipes\, saz\, m
 andolin\, bouzouki\, and santoor – Wells-Oberegger has been professional
 ly involved in the early and world music scenes for more than 20 years. Re
 lying on a solid academic training coupled with his knowledge of internati
 onal musical traditions\, he has worked with various ensembles including L
 a Nef\, La Mandragore\, ESEM\, Cercamon\, De Lònga\, and La Strada. For t
 his concert\, he will be joined by Pierre-Alexandre Saint-Yves on chalumea
 u (a Baroque woodwind instrument) and voice. A lover of ancient music and 
 instruments from diverse cultures\, Wells-Oberegger was influenced by arti
 sts like Nick Cave\, Leonard Cohen\, Bon Iver\, Sufjan Stevens\, Grizzly B
 ear\, Anouar Brahem\, Peter Gabriel\, Erik Satie\, Maurice Ravel\, and Ara
 m Khachaturian. Artist Group Info Andrew Wells-Oberegger https://www.awomu
 sique.com/ 215 Pleasant Street Sheldon \, Vermont 05483 802-498-8715 beth.
 daybell@gmail.com http://gracechurchsheldon.com Submit An Event Find out w
