BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harpoon x L.L.Bean Flannel Friday Launch Party
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260906
DTSTAMP:20260904T150035Z
UID:d22ee4046d0d34f2a6bd1a6b78bfba@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Harpoon Brewery and L.L.Bean at the Harpoon Brewery & Tap
 room in Windsor\, Vermont for the official launch of Harpoon x L.L.Bean Fl
 annel Friday\, our limited-edition collaboration beer inspired by the trad
 itions that make autumn in New England unforgettable. Whether you’re sto
 pping by for a pint\, bringing the family for an afternoon outdoors\, or j
 ust looking for one more great way to spend Labor Day Weekend\, we’ve go
 t plenty waiting for you. Saturday\, September 5 Rain Date: Friday\, Septe
 mber 4 Harpoon Brewery Windsor\, VT What to Expect 🍺 Be among the first
  to enjoy Flannel Friday Celebrate the release of our newest collaboration
  with special Flannel Friday beer offerings available throughout the event
 . 🎁 Win L.L.Bean Prizes Enter for your chance to take home great gear f
 rom L.L.Bean. 👢 Explore the L.L.Bean Bootmobile The legendary Bootmobil
 e will be on-site and ready for photos throughout the afternoon. 🎶 Live
  Music Kick back with live local music while enjoying the brewery lawn. 
 🎯 Lawn Games & Outdoor Fun Cornhole\, yard games\, family-friendly acti
 vities\, and plenty of space to relax. 🔥 Complimentary S’mores by the
  Fire Pit Gather around the fire and enjoy a classic New England treat whi
 le supplies last. 🌭 Great Food & Fresh Beer Our kitchen will be serving
  up brewery favorites alongside fresh Harpoon beer. 🥤Complimentary Root
  Beer Floats A classic New England favorite for the little adventurers. St
 op by for a free root beer float while supplies last. 🛍️ Exclusive Ha
 rpoon x L.L.Bean Merchandise Shop limited-edition collaboration merchandis
 e including flannels\, hats & much more! 🐶 Dogs Welcome Well-behaved\, 
 leashed dogs are invited to join in the fun\, too. Celebrate the Best of N
 ew England Flannel Friday is more than just a beer—it’s a celebration 
 of getting outside\, gathering with friends\, and embracing everything we 
 love about New England in the fall. Whether your perfect autumn day includ
 es a hike\, a campfire\, a brewery visit\, or simply spending time with fa
 mily and friends\, this event is the perfect way to kick off the season. S
 o grab your favorite flannel\, gather your crew\, and join us in Windsor f
 or an unforgettable afternoon. Admission This event is free to attend and 
 open to guests of all ages. Food\, beverages\, and merchandise will be ava
 ilable for purchase.\n\nSources: Vermont.com\, Vermont Public
LOCATION:Harpoon Taproom and Beer Garden\, 336 Ruth Carney Drive
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/harpoon-x-
 l-l-bean-flannel-friday-launch-party-14-08-2026-15-41-18
END:VEVENT
