BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kinhaven Fall Concert Series
DTSTART:20260905T170000
DTEND:20260905T180000
DTSTAMP:20260904T150035Z
UID:12b2ce142e80e88fd4bb39549ad45c@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for inspiring performances by our Semester Program stu
 dents\, the Trillium String Quartet\, violinist Deborah Buck\, and special
  guest artists\, in partnership with venues across Southern VT and NY. Mor
 e concerts will be announced soon! Kinhaven celebrates its milestone 75th 
 Anniversary in 2027\, as well as the second year of its Semester Program i
 ntensive for exceptional high school string students in collaboration with
  Burr and Burton Academy (BBA). The first of its kind in the nation\, the 
 Semester Program combines high-level academics at BBA with rigorous musica
 l training at Kinhaven\, where students live\, study\, and perform with ea
 ch other and artistic faculty\, the Trillium String Quartet\, with violini
 st and Co-Executive Director Deborah Buck.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Manchester Community Library\, 138 Cemetery Ave
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/kinhaven-f
 all-concert-series-21-08-2026-14-22-54
END:VEVENT
